# Responses of different kinds, to see how each one is shown.
# Save any body with "Save Body…" under the response.

### PNG image
GET {{httpbin}}/image/png

> assert headers["content-type"] == "image/png"

### SVG image
GET {{httpbin}}/image/svg

### Dog photo
@needs randomDog
GET {{randomDog.body.message}}

> assert status == 200

### HTML page
GET {{httpbin}}/html

> assert text contains "Herman Melville"

### XML document
GET {{httpbin}}/xml

### PDF download
GET https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf

> assert headers["content-type"] contains "pdf"

### Attachment
GET {{httpbin}}/response-headers?Content-Type=text/csv&Content-Disposition=attachment%3B%20filename%3D%22report.csv%22

### Random bytes
GET {{httpbin}}/bytes/512

> assert size == 512
